	      <div id="description-wrapper" class="description-wrapper">
        <div id="description-content" class="description-content" data-nosnippet>	 
            All contents of &#39;Deokhujjjang video&#39; (hereinafter &#39;app&#39;) are<br>It is an app that connects directly to a video published on the Internet with a link.<br><br>In &#39;App&#39;, search results (specific keywords and related searches) on the Internet (Web) are displayed.<br>We collect and provide links to videos.<br><br>Searched video links are Naver, Daum, Youtube, Google, Bing, Yahoo<br>etc., and the search results change in real time.<br>Search results may also change.<br>In the case of a Google search, the content of the saved page is also referred to.<br><br>The video of the searched content is Naver, Daum, Pandora, Youtube,<br>You can contact the relevant service company such as Dailymotion or Facebook.<br><br>The &#39;app&#39; has only searched link information, and the link can be<br>It may be deleted and cannot be played, and the app does not have any videos.<br><br>The rights to all videos and information belong to the respective copyright holder,<br>We inform you that the link will be deleted at the request of the right holder.<br><br>We do not store any personal information of users on the server.<br><br>Inquiries can be sent from the [Contact Us] menu.<br><br>■ Permissions and Reasons Used in the App<br>- Permission to use network connection [required]<br><br>- Permission used to check network status [required]<br><br>- Permission used to check wi-fi connection status [required]<br><br>- Permission to write bookmark information stored in the device [required]<br><br>- Permission to read bookmark information stored in the device [required]<br><br>- Permission to install update apps when there is an app update [required]<br><br>- Ad ID permission used when displaying in-app advertisements [required]<br>			        </div>
		<p class="source-note">Source: Official app description retrieved from <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.dukhujjang.video&hl=en" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Google Play</a>. Provided for reference only.</p>	
